Description: Power panel: Screensaver group replaces Automatic Screen Blank (Pi-Desktop)
 Pi-Desktop uses a screensaver instead of blanking the screen. The former blank-screen
 group now shows the settings of the pidesktop-screensaver user service: file, delay,
 lock, folder and preview.
 Hidden automatically when the org.pidesktop.screensaver schema (or a key it needs) is absent.
Author: defcom5-rockchip
Forwarded: not-needed

